Balcony

The balcony is quite large, and is has a quite high railing. It is higher than me. This is very disappointing, I have no view at all. I don't recall it being so high. Or maybe it is just me being very small. Anyway, all I can see outside is the sky. I can go back in the common room (direction: in).
> throw bundle over railing

> throw bundle over railing
The bundle flies over the railing and just makes it before the wind catches it. It separates mid-air and the book falls down with a smack on the terrace below. There is a loud exclamation by someone down there:

- What the... Where did that come from? Better put it back where it belongs.

The towel continues to fly with the wind, far away south until I lose sight of it.
