Seaside of house

Seaside of house, there is a large stone terrace with some chairs and a table. The house has many windows, and a balcony on the upper floor. From an overhead tree branch hangs a large bell. I can go around the house south or north, or down the stairs towards the sea. There is a large double door leading into the living room.
