Sand pit

 The sun shines more brightly here than anywhere else and it is quite hot on the dry sand. The dense forest looms nearby and I should not attempt it, but there is a small breach in the vegetation to the south.
> take lens

> take lens
I carefully take it. But I cannot move while holding it.
> burn torch with lens

> burn torch with lens
This will be my finest moment. At last it will come true. Finally it will end.
--------

Holding up the torch I let sunlight concentrate on it through the lens. After I while I am rewarded: The torch catches fire and shines with a steady flame. Wow! I have never seen anything like it.

I am empowered by the flame and this gives me confidence to reflect on my purpose. Gilleholmen is soon only a memory and someone needs to guard it. And so I know what to do. The guardian I met is old and week. Gilleholmen needs a new guardian to better take care of it. And I am the one. I am sure of it.

I am fire in the dark. I am burning with certainty. It now comes down to this. I must confront the guardian in the cave and finish all this. There is no more delaying the inevitable. This will be the end.

A moment of hesitation: If I do this I will stay here forever. Or until someone replaces me in a distant future. But I do not waver: my place is here. This is where I want to be. Let's not linger any more.

Let's get this done.

> put lens in bucket

> put lens in bucket
I carefully place the bottle bottom in the bucket. Now I need not worry about the sharp edges!
